/Contents (Observe que o trabalho\rdeve ser iniciado com \requações bem simples, na\rforma \(x + a\)2 = b2, onde\ra e b são inteiros.)
/CreationDate (D:20150907170709-03'00')
/DA (0 0 0 rg /F1 12 Tf)
/DS (font-family:Courier New;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;)
/F 4
/IT /FreeTextTypewriter
/M (D:20150907170823-03'00')
/NM (a9535da1-f108-4083-94d6ba267a354737)
/P 16 0 R
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:10.1.5" xfa:spec="2.0.2" style="text-align:left;line-height:normal;font-family:Courier New;font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;text-valign:top;"><p style="color:#FF0000;"><span>Observe&#32;que&#32;o&#32;trabalho&#13;</span><span>deve&#32;ser&#32;iniciado&#32;com&#32;&#13;</span><span>equa&#231;&#245;es&#32;bem&#32;simples,&#32;na&#13;</span><span>forma&#32;\(x&#32;+&#32;a\)</span><span style="font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:0.0pt;"><sup>2</sup></span><span>&#32;=&#32;b</span><span style="font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:0.0pt;"><sup>2</sup></span><span>,&#32;onde&#13;</span><span>a&#32;e&#32;b&#32;s&#227;o&#32;inteiros.</span></p></body>)
/Rect [414.174012 411.805054 592.25647 480.106415]
/Subj (Máquina de Escrever)
/Subtype /FreeText
/T (Anne)
/Type /Annot
>>
